msgstr "Uporablja YubiKey [HOTP]"

msgid "Change HOTP Secret"
msgstr "Spremeni skrivni kod HOTP"

msgid ""
"Enter a new HOTP secret formatted as a 40-digit hexadecimal string. Spaces "
"will be ignored:"
msgstr "Vnesite novo skrivnost HOTP, oblikovano kot 40-mestni šestnajstiški niz. Presledki bodo prezrti:"

msgid "Once you have configured your YubiKey, enter the 6-digit code below:"
msgstr "Ko ste konfigurirali svoj YubiKey, vnesite spodnjo 6-mestno kodo:"

msgid ""
"You're almost done! To finish adding this new user, have them follow the "
"instructions below to set up two-factor authentication with FreeOTP. Once "
"they've added an entry for this account in the app, have them enter one of "
"the 6-digit codes from the app to confirm that two-factor authentication is "
"set up correctly."
msgstr "Skoraj ste končali! Če želite dokončati dodajanje tega novega uporabnika, naj sledi spodnjim navodilom za nastavitev dvo-faktorske avtentikacije s FreeOTP. Ko v aplikacijo doda vnos za ta račun, naj vnese eno od 6-mestnih kod iz aplikacije, da potrdi, da je dvo-faktorska avtentikacija pravilno nastavljena."

msgid ""
"Can't scan the barcode? You can manually pair FreeOTP with this account by "
"entering the following two-factor secret into the app:"
msgstr "Ne morete skenirati črtne kode? FreeOTP lahko ročno povežete s tem računom tako, da v aplikacijo vnesete naslednji dvo-faktorski skrivni kod:"

msgid ""
"<strong>Critical:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;The operating system used by your "
"SecureDrop servers has reached its end-of-life. A manual update is required "
"to re-enable the Source Interface and remain safe. Please contact your "
"administrator. <a href=\"https://securedrop.org/noble-eol\" "
"rel=\"noreferrer\">Learn More</a>"
msgstr "<strong>Kritično:</strong> Operacijski sistem, ki ga uporabljajo vaši strežniki SecureDrop, je dosegel konec svoje življenjske dobe. Za ponovno omogočanje izvornega vmesnika in ohranitev varnosti je potrebna ročna posodobitev. Obrnite se na skrbnika. <a href=\"https://securedrop.org/noble-eol\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Poučite se več o tem</a>"

