msgstr "Vi ste tukaj:"

msgid "All Sources"
msgstr "Vsi viri"

msgid ""
"All messages, files, and replies from sources are stored as encrypted files "
"for security. To read them, you will need to decrypt them on your Secure "
"Viewing Station."
msgstr "Vsa sporočila, datoteke in odgovori virov so zaradi varnosti shranjeni kot šifrirane datoteke. Če jih želite prebrati, jih boste morali dešifrirati na svoji varni ogledovalni postaji."

