msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the selected submissions?"
msgstr "Ali ste prepričani, da želite izbrisati izbrane oddaje?"

msgid "No submissions to display."
msgstr "Ni prispevkov za prikaz."

msgid ""
"You can write a secure reply to the person who submitted these messages and/"
"or files:"
msgstr "Osebi, ki je poslala ta sporočila in/ali datoteke, lahko napišete varen odgovor:"

msgid "Write a reply."
msgstr "Napišite odgovor."

msgid "Submit reply"
msgstr "Pošlji odgovor"

msgid "This source has no encryption key."
msgstr "Ta vir nima šifrirnega ključa."

msgid ""
"An encryption key will be generated for the source the next time they log "
"in, after which you will be able to reply to the source here."
msgstr "Ob naslednji prijavi vira bo ustvarjen šifrirni ključ, s katerim boste lahko viru odgovorili tukaj."

msgid "Delete Source Account"
msgstr "Izbriši izvorni račun"

msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Ali ste prepričani?"

msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Deleting the account for <b>{source}</b> will:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>prevent them from logging in with their codename again\n"
"<li>prevent your organization from sending replies\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"All files, messages, and replies will also be deleted when their account is "
"deleted.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr "<p>\nČe izbrišete račun za <b>{source}</b>, boste:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li>preprečili, da bi se ponovno prijavili s svojim kodnim imenom\n<li>vaša organizacija ne bi mogla pošiljati odgovorov\n</ul>\n<p>\nKo izbrišete njihov račun, bodo izbrisane tudi vse datoteke, sporočila in odgovori.\n</p>"

msgid "Yes, Delete Source Account"
msgstr "Da, izbriši izvorni račun"

