"is present and ready to set up their device with the new two-factor "
"credentials. Otherwise, they will be locked out of their account.</em>"
msgstr "Če so uporabnikove poverilnice za dvo-faktorsko avtentikacijo izgubljene ali ogrožene, jih lahko tukaj ponastavite. <em>Če to storite, se prepričajte, da je uporabnik prisoten in pripravljen nastaviti svojo napravo z novimi dvo-faktorskimi poverilnicami. V nasprotnem primeru bo zaklenjen do svojega računa.</em>"

msgid ""
"If your two-factor authentication credentials have been lost or compromised, "
"or you got a new device, you can reset your credentials here. <em>If you do "
"this, make sure you are ready to set up your new device, otherwise you will "
"be locked out of your account.</em>"
msgstr "Če so vaše poverilnice za dvo-faktorsko avtentikacijo izgubljene ali ogrožene ali če imate novo napravo, jih lahko ponastavite tukaj. <em>Če to storite, se prepričajte, da ste pripravljeni na nastavitev nove naprave, sicer boste izgubili dostop do svojega računa.</em>"

msgid ""
"To reset two-factor authentication for mobile apps such as FreeOTP, choose "
