msgstr "Žal je na spletnem mestu prišlo do napake in vaše zahteve ni bilo mogoče dokončati."

msgid "Look up a codename..."
msgstr "Poišči kodno ime..."

msgid "Powered by"
msgstr "Poganja"

msgid ""
"Please note: Sharing sensitive information may put you at risk, even when "
"using Tor and SecureDrop."
msgstr "Upoštevajte: Deljenje občutljivih informacij vas lahko izpostavi tveganju, tudi če uporabljate Tor in SecureDrop."

msgid "SecureDrop is a project of Freedom of the Press Foundation."
msgstr "SecureDrop je projekt fundacije Freedom of the Press Foundation."

msgid "Get Your Codename"
msgstr "Pridobite svoje kodno ime"

msgid ""
"A <em>codename</em> in SecureDrop functions as both your username and your "
"password."
msgstr "<em>Kodno ime</em> v SecureDrop funkcijah deluje oboje kot vaše uporabniško ime in kot geslo."

msgid "You will need this codename to log into our SecureDrop later:"
msgstr "To kodno ime boste potrebovali za kasnejšo prijavo v naš SecureDrop:"

msgid "<strong>Keep it secret.</strong> Do not share it with anyone."
msgstr "<strong>Naj ostane skrivnost.</strong> Ne delite tega z nikomer."

msgid "<strong>Keep it safe.</strong> There is no account recovery option."
msgstr "<strong>Hranite ga na varnem.</strong> Ni možnosti obnovitve računa."

msgid "Continue to Submission Page"
msgstr "Nadaljujte na stran za oddajo"

msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Dobrodošli"

msgid ""
"Your Tor Browser's <a id=\"disable-js\" href=\"\"><b>Security Level</b></a> "
"is too low. Use the <img src=\"{icon}\" alt=\"&quot;Security Level&quot;\"> "
"button in your browser’s toolbar to change it."
msgstr "<a id=\"disable-js\" href=\"\"><b>Raven varnosti</b></a> vašega brskalnika Tor je prenizka. Za spremembo uporabite gumb <img src=\"{icon}\" alt=\"&quot;Security Level&quot;\"> v orodni vrstici brskalnika."

msgid "How to change your security level"
msgstr "Kako spremeniti raven varnosti"

msgid ""
"Click the <img src=\"{icon}\" alt=\"&quot;Security Level&quot; button\"> in "
"the toolbar above"
msgstr "Kliknite <img src=\"{icon}\" alt=\"&quot;Raven varnosti&quot; button\"> v zgornji orodni vrstici"

msgid "Click <b>Settings</b> to open Security Level preferences"
msgstr "Kliknite <b>Nastavitve</b>, da odprete preference ravni varnosti"

msgid "Click <b>Change…</b> and select <b>Safest</b>"
msgstr "Kliknite <b>Spremeni…</b> in izberite <b>Najvarnejše</b>"

msgid "Click <b>Save and restart.</b>"
msgstr "Kliknite <b>Shrani in znova zaženi.</b>"

msgid ""
"Tor Browser will restart, with its security level set to <b>Safest</b>. "
"After the restart, come back to this site."
msgstr "Brskalnik Tor se bo znova zagnal, raven varnosti pa bo nastavljena na <b>Najvarnejšo</b>. Po ponovnem zagonu se vrnite na to spletno mesto."

msgid ""
"<strong>It is recommended to use Tor Browser to access SecureDrop:</strong> "
"<a class=\"recommend-tor\" href=\"{tor_browser_url}\">Learn how to install "
"it</a>, or ignore this warning to continue."
msgstr "<strong>Za dostop do SecureDropa priporočamo uporabo brskalnika Tor:</strong> <a class=\"recommend-tor\" href=\"{tor_browser_url}\">Preberite, kako ga namestite</a> ali pa prezrite to opozorilo, da nadaljujete."

msgid ""
"<strong>It is recommended you use the desktop version of Tor Browser to "
"access SecureDrop, as Tor Browser for Android does not provide the same "
"level of security and anonymity as the desktop version.</strong> <a "
"class=\"recommend-tor\" aria-label=\"Learn how to install Tor Browser\" "
"href=\"{tor_browser_url}\" >Learn how to install it</a>, or ignore this "
"warning to continue."
msgstr "<strong>Za dostop do SecureDropa priporočamo uporabo namizne različice brskalnika Tor, saj brskalnik Tor za Android ne zagotavlja enake ravni varnosti in anonimnosti kot namizna različica.</strong> <a class=\"recommend-tor\" aria-label=\"Naučite se namestiti brskalnik Tor\" href=\"{tor_browser_url}\" >Naučite se namestiti brskalnik</a> ali pa prezrite to opozorilo, da nadaljujete."

msgid "{} logo"
msgstr "{} logotip"

