msgstr "Prva oddaja"

msgid "First time submitting to our SecureDrop? Start here."
msgstr "Prvič oddajate v našo SecureDrop? Začnite tukaj."

msgid "Get Started With Your First Submission"
msgstr "Začnite s svojo prvo oddajo"

msgid "GET STARTED"
msgstr "ZAČNITE"

msgid "Return visit"
msgstr "Ponovni obisk"

msgid "Already have a codename? Check for replies or submit something new."
msgstr "Že imate kodno ime? Preverite odgovore ali oddajte nekaj novega."

msgid "Log In Using Your Codename"
msgstr "Prijava s svojim kodnim imenom"

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Prijava"

msgid "Enter Codename"
msgstr "Vnesite kodno ime"

msgid "Enter your codename"
msgstr "Vnesite vaše kodno ime"

msgid "Cancel and Return to Previous Page"
msgstr "Prekliči in se vrni na prejšnjo stran"

msgid "CANCEL"
msgstr "PREKLIČI"

msgid "Additional Action Required"
msgstr "Potrebno je dodatno ukrepanje"

msgid "Log Back In"
msgstr "Prijava nazaj"

msgid "One more thing..."
msgstr "Še ena stvar..."

msgid ""
"Click the <img src={icon} alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<b>New "
"Identity</b> button in your Tor Browser's toolbar. This will clear your Tor "
"Browser activity data on this device."
msgstr "Kliknite gumb <img src={icon} alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<b>Nova identiteta</b> v orodni vrstici brskalnika Tor. S tem boste izbrisali podatke o dejavnosti brskalnika Tor v tej napravi."

msgid "Submit Files or Messages"
msgstr "Pošlji datoteke ali sporočila"

msgid "Submit Messages"
msgstr "Pošlji sporočila"

msgid "You can submit any kind of file, a message, or both."
msgstr "Pošljete lahko katero koli datoteko, sporočilo ali oboje."

msgid ""
"If you are already familiar with GPG, you can optionally encrypt your files "
"and messages with our <a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">public key</a> "
"before submission. Files are encrypted as they are received by SecureDrop."
msgstr "Če že poznate GPG, lahko svoje datoteke in sporočila pred oddajo po želji šifrirate z našim <a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">javnim ključem</a>. Datoteke so šifrirane, ko jih prejme SecureDrop."

msgid ""
"If you are already familiar with GPG, you can optionally encrypt your "
"messages with our <a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">public key</a> "
"before submission."
msgstr "Če že poznate GPG, lahko svoja sporočila pred pošiljanjem po želji šifrirate z našim <a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">javnim ključem</a>."

msgid "<a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">Learn more</a>."
msgstr "<a href=\"{url}\" class=\"text-link\">Naučite se več</a>."

msgid "Maximum upload size: 500 MB"
msgstr "Največja velikost prenašanja tja: 500 MB"

msgid ""
"If you are only sending a message, it must be at least {} characters long."
msgstr "Če pošiljate samo sporočilo, mora biti dolgo vsaj {} znakov."

msgid "Anti-spam check. Do not fill this in!"
msgstr "Preverjanje neželene pošte. Ne izpolnjujte tega polja!"

msgid "Cancel and Clear Uploaded Content"
msgstr "Prekliči in počisti naloženo vsebino"

msgid "Submit Uploaded Content"
msgstr "Pošlji naloženo vsebino"

msgid "Read Replies"
msgstr "Preberi odgovore"

msgid ""
"You have received a reply. To protect your identity in the unlikely event "
"someone learns your codename, please delete all replies when you're done "
"with them. This also lets us know that you are aware of our reply. You can "
"respond by submitting new files and messages above."
msgstr "Prejeli ste odgovor. Da bi zaščitili svojo identiteto v malo verjetnem primeru, da bi kdo izvedel vaše kodno ime, vas prosimo, da po končanem delu z odgovori izbrišete vse odgovore. S tem nam tudi sporočite, da ste seznanjeni z našim odgovorom. Zgoraj lahko odgovorite tako, da pošljete nove datoteke in sporočila."

msgid "Delete this reply"
msgstr "Izbriši ta odgovor"

msgid "Delete reply from {timestamp}?"
msgstr "Naj zbrišem odgovor od {timestamp}?"

msgid "Delete Reply"
msgstr "Izbriši odgovor"

msgid "Delete All Replies"
msgstr "Izbriši vse odgovore"

msgid "DELETE ALL REPLIES"
msgstr "IZBRIŠI VSE ODGOVORE"

msgid "Are you finished with the replies?"
msgstr "Ste končali z odgovori?"

msgid "YES, DELETE ALL REPLIES"
msgstr "DA, ZBRIŠI VSE ODGOVORE"

msgid "No Messages"
msgstr "Ni sporočil"

msgid "Page not found"
msgstr "Strani ni bilo mogoče najti"

msgid "Sorry, we couldn't locate what you requested."
msgstr "Žal nismo mogli najti tistega, kar ste zahtevali."

msgid "Warning: Proxy Detected"
msgstr "Opozorilo: Zaznan je bil posredniški strežnik"

msgid "Proxy Service Detected"
msgstr "Zaznan je bil posredniški strežnik"

msgid ""
"You appear to be using a Tor proxy service to access SecureDrop. Proxy "
"services do not protect your anonymity."
msgstr "Zdi se, da za dostop do SecureDropa uporabljate storitev posrednika Tor. Storitve posrednika ne ščitijo vaše anonimnosti."

msgid ""
"Anyone monitoring your Internet traffic &mdash; including your government, "
"your Internet provider, or the proxy operator &mdash; may be able to "
"identify you."
msgstr "Vsakdo, ki spremlja vaš internetni promet – vključno z vašo vlado, vašim ponudnikom internetnih storitev ali operaterjem posredniškega strežnika – vas lahko identificira."

msgid ""
"Always use Tor Browser (<code>{}</code>) to access SecureDrop. Valid "
"SecureDrop site addresses end with <code>.onion</code>. The correct address "
"for this site is:"
msgstr "Za dostop do SecureDropa vedno uporabljajte brskalnik Tor (<code>{}</code>). Veljavni naslovi spletnih mest SecureDrop se končajo z <code>.onion</code>. Pravilni naslov za to spletno mesto je:"

msgid ""
"If you are already using Tor Browser, copy the address above and click Tor "
"Browser's <strong>New Identity</strong> button before you access SecureDrop."
msgstr "Če že uporabljate brskalnik Tor, kopirajte zgornji naslov in kliknite gumb <strong>Nova identiteta</strong> v brskalniku Tor, preden dostopate do SecureDrop."

msgid ""
"If there is a reasonable risk of your Internet traffic being monitored, "
"consider connecting from a different location or network."
msgstr "Če obstaja razumno tveganje, da se vaš internetni promet spremlja, razmislite o povezavi z druge lokacije ali omrežja."

msgid "You Should Use Tor Browser"
msgstr "Uporabiti morate brskalnik Tor"

msgid ""
"If you are not using Tor Browser, you <strong>may not be anonymous</strong>."
msgstr "Če ne uporabljate brskalnika Tor, <strong>morda niste anonimni</strong>."

msgid ""
"If you want to submit information to SecureDrop, we <strong>strongly advise "
"you</strong> to install Tor Browser and use it to access our site safely and "
"anonymously."
msgstr "Če želite posredovati podatke storitvi SecureDrop, vam <strong>toplo priporočamo</strong>, da namestite brskalnik Tor in ga uporabljate za varen in anonimen dostop do našega spletnega mesta."

msgid ""
"Copy and paste the following address into your browser and follow the "
"instructions to download and install Tor Browser:"
msgstr "Kopirajte in prilepite naslednji naslov v brskalnik ter sledite navodilom za prenos in namestitev brskalnik Tor:"

msgid ""
"If there is a chance that downloading Tor Browser raises suspicion and your "
"mail provider is less likely to be monitored, you can send a mail to "
"<kbd>gettor@torproject.org</kbd> and a bot will answer with instructions."
msgstr "Če obstaja možnost, da prenos brskalnika Tor vzbuja sum in je manj verjetno, da bo vaš ponudnik e-pošte nadzorovan, lahko pošljete e-pošto na <kbd>gettor@torproject.org</kbd> in bot vam bo odgovoril z navodili."

msgid "Remember, your codename is:"
msgstr "Ne pozabite, da je vaše kodno ime:"

msgid "Codename"
msgstr "Kodno ime"

msgid "Reveal Codename"
msgstr "Razkrij kodno ime"

msgid "Show Codename"
msgstr "Prikaži kodno ime"

msgid "Why download the team's public key?"
msgstr "Zakaj prenesti javni ključ ekipe?"

msgid ""
"SecureDrop encrypts files and messages after they are submitted. Encrypting "
"messages and files before submission can provide an extra layer of security "
"before your data reaches the SecureDrop server."
msgstr "SecureDrop šifrira datoteke in sporočila po tem, ko so poslana. Šifriranje sporočil in datotek pred pošiljanjem lahko zagotovi dodatno plast varnosti, preden vaši podatki dosežejo strežnik SecureDrop."

msgid ""
"If you are already familiar with the GPG encryption software, you may wish "
"to encrypt your submissions yourself. To do so:"
msgstr "Če že poznate programsko opremo za šifriranje GPG, boste morda želeli svoje oddaje šifrirati sami. To storite tako:"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"{url}\">Download</a> the public key. It will be saved to a file "
"called:\n"
"        <p><code>{submission_key_fpr_filename}</code></p>"
msgstr "<a href=\"{url}\">Prenesite</a> javni ključ. Shranjen bo v datoteko z imenom:\n        <p><code>{submission_key_fpr_filename}</code></p>"

msgid "Import it into your GPG keyring."
msgstr "Uvozite ga v svoj GPG obesek za ključe."

msgid ""
"If you are using <a href=\"{url}\">Tails</a>, you can double-click the "
"<code>.asc</code> file you just downloaded and it will be automatically "
"imported to your keyring."
msgstr "Če uporabljate <a href=\"{url}\">Tails</a>, lahko dvokliknete datoteko <code>.asc</code>, ki ste jo pravkar prenesli, in samodejno bo uvožena v vaš obesek ključev."

msgid ""
"If you are using macOS or Linux, open the terminal. You can import the key "
"with:<p><code>gpg --import /path/to/{submission_key_fpr_filename}</code></p>"
msgstr "Če uporabljate macOS ali Linux, odprite terminal. Ključ lahko uvozite z:<p><code>gpg --import /path/to/{submission_key_fpr_filename}</code></p>"

msgid "Encrypt your submission. Open the terminal and enter this gpg command:"
msgstr "Šifrirajte svojo oddajo. Odprite terminal in vnesite ta ukaz gpg:"

msgid ""
"<code>gpg --recipient '{submission_key_fpr}' --encrypt /path/to/submission</"
"code>"
msgstr "<code>gpg --recipient '{submission_key_fpr}' --encrypt /path/to/submission</code>"

msgid ""
"Upload your encrypted submission. It will have the same filename as the "
"unencrypted file, with .gpg at the end (e.g. <code>internal_memo.pdf.gpg</"
"code>)"
msgstr "Prenesite tja svojo šifrirano oddajo. Imela bo enako ime datoteke kot nešifrirana datoteka, s pripono .gpg na koncu (npr. <code>internal_memo.pdf.gpg</code>)"

msgid ""
"<strong>Important:</strong> If you wish to remain anonymous, <strong>do not</"
"strong> use GPG to sign the encrypted file (with the <code>--sign</code> or "
"<code>-s</code> flag) as this will reveal your GPG identity to us."
msgstr "<strong>Pomembno:</strong> Če želite ostati anonimni, <strong>ne</strong> uporabljajte GPG za podpisovanje šifrirane datoteke (z zastavico <code>--sign</code> ali <code>-s</code>), saj nam boste s tem razkrili svojo GPG identiteto."

msgid "Back to submission page"
msgstr "Nazaj na stran za oddajo"

#~ msgid "Invalid OTP secret"
#~ msgstr "Neveljavno OTP geslo"
